  "notable_quotes": [
    "CO2 induces H2O to form more connected H-bond networks in smaller regions, which slows water reorientation and lowers water entropy.",
    "Because they compete for the same void spaces, both H2O and CO2 diffuse more slowly when the other guest species is present in CALF-20.",
    "Although adsorption is mainly set by each species' partial pressure, H2O and CO2 loadings are also altered by the other gas via cooperative effects."
